{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113081844897-1113_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261113093531\"/><p>微軟365全球服務故障。</p><p>美國微軟公司旗下微軟365全球服務美東周四（12日）下午1時許（香港周三凌晨1時許）開始大當機，服務中斷影響數十萬名用戶。</p><p>網絡故障追蹤網站Downdetector監測數據顯示，故障發生初期，全球有近13萬名用戶提交Outlook無法使用的報告。數千名用戶反映訪問Microsoft Teams時遇到連接異常。微軟指，正調查美洲地區用戶透過多種連接方式存取Exchange Online郵箱時遇到的問題。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:43:47.538792+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T00:18:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T01:37:22.518592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:37:22.518592+00:00","content_hash":"a5ae895cc0ef36bf53b835fedb30f05ead56075602f275684e5b16b5ab9ee929","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}